# Setlist Archive Loading Cards (/archive)

All `/archive` pages that show a loading state must use `LoadingPageCard` with:

1. **Descriptive message**: `"Loading <context> data…"` or context-specific text
2. **Progress bar**: shadcn `Progress` component showing completion
3. **Percentage**: Numeric progress (0–100%) so users know why they're waiting

## Implementation

Use `LoadingPageCard` from `@/components/dpro/loading-page-card`:

```tsx
<LoadingPageCard
  message="Loading 2025 data…"   // or page-specific (e.g. "Loading Arcadia…", "Loading 03.15.25…")
  page="years"                    // fallback when message not provided
  progress={progress}             // 0–100, from your data hook
/>
```

## Message Conventions

- **Years**: `Loading {year} data…` (e.g. "Loading 2025 data…")
- **Tours**: `Loading {tour name} data…` (e.g. "Loading 2025 Winter data…")
- **Setlists**: `Loading {mm.dd.yy}…` (e.g. "Loading 03.15.25…") — use `formatSetlistDate(show.show_date)`
- **Individual song**: `Loading {song name}…` (e.g. "Loading Arcadia…") — no "data"
- **Stats / Songs**: lowercase `"Loading stats data…"`, `"Loading songs data…"`

## Progress Tracking

Data hooks should expose `progress?: number` (0–100) when loading. Compute from loaded steps:

```ts
const progress = loading && totalSteps > 0
  ? (loadedSteps / totalSteps) * 100
  : undefined
```

## UI Structure (shadcn)

The loading card uses `Field`, `FieldLabel`, and `Progress` per [shadcn Progress docs](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components/radix/progress):

- Label on left, percentage on right
- Progress bar below
- `progress` prop drives both bar and percentage

## Checklist when adding /archive pages

- [ ] Use `LoadingPageCard` for loading state
- [ ] Pass context-specific `message` when available
- [ ] Pass `progress` from data hook (0–100) when loading has multiple steps
- [ ] Follow message conventions above
